// perf round 24 heavy book: 300 measures of tuplets+scripts+beams.
// Notes BELOW the middle (stems up, accents auto = below): the script
// points can never win an UP bracket, the beamed tuplet spans its own
// beam (member-X == old attach math) — OUTPUT MUST MATCH BASE while the
// new sieve + per-tuplet script scans run at full weight.
octave absolute
time 4/4

part v { }

section Main {
